                     "ref":  "home",
                     "title":  "Home",
                     "slug":  "home",
                     "template":  "home",
                     "vars":  {
                                  "heroTitle":  "Beautiful documentation, built in minutes",
                                  "heroMessage":  "A clean, fast, dark-first docs theme for PRSS. Grouped sidebar navigation, an on-page table of contents, copyable code blocks, and callouts — everything you need to write great docs.",
                                  "heroPrimaryText":  "Get started",
                                  "heroPrimaryUrl":  "getting-started/introduction",
                                  "heroSecondaryText":  "Browse components",
                                  "heroSecondaryUrl":  "components/gradient-glow"
                              },
                     "content":  "\u003cdiv class=\"docs-cards\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"docs-card\"\u003e\u003ch3\u003eFast to write\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eEvery page is a normal PRSS page. Type, drop in a code block or a callout, and publish.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"docs-card\"\u003e\u003ch3\u003eOrganized\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eGroup pages into sections. The sidebar and previous/next links are generated for you.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"docs-card\"\u003e\u003ch3\u003eReader-friendly\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eAn automatic “On this page” outline, dark mode, and a keyboard-accessible layout.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e",
                     "children":  [
                                      {
                                          "ref":  "gs",
                                          "title":  "Getting Started",
                                          "slug":  "getting-started",
                                          "template":  "docs",
                                          "content":  "\u003cp\u003eEverything you need to stand up a documentation site with PRSS. Start with the introduction, then install and ship your first page.\u003c/p\u003e",
                                          "children":  [
                                                           {
                                                               "ref":  "gs-intro",
                                                               "title":  "Introduction",
                                                               "slug":  "introduction",
                                                               "template":  "docs",
                                                               "content":  "\u003cp\u003eThis starter is a fully working documentation site. Edit these pages, add your own, and organize them into sections — the navigation, table of contents, and previous/next links all update automatically.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eWhat you get\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eGrouped sidebar\u003c/strong\u003e generated from your site structure.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOn-page outline\u003c/strong\u003e built from the headings you write.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCode blocks\u003c/strong\u003e with one-click copy.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCallouts\u003c/strong\u003e for notes, tips, and warnings.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"callout\" data-type=\"info\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTip:\u003c/strong\u003e Every item in the sidebar is just a page. Add a page under a section and it appears here instantly.\u003c/div\u003e\u003ch2\u003eHow pages are organized\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eSections are pages that contain other pages. The theme renders the top level of your structure as sidebar groups and their children as links.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eNext steps\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eHead to \u003ca href=\"../getting-started/installation\"\u003eInstallation\u003c/a\u003e to learn how to add and arrange pages.\u003c/p\u003e"
                                                           },
                                                           {
                                                               "ref":  "gs-install",
                                                               "title":  "Installation",
                                                               "slug":  "installation",
                                                               "template":  "docs",
                                                               "content":  "\u003cp\u003eYou don\u0027t install anything to use this theme — it ships with PRSS. This page shows how to add content.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eAdd a page\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eCreate a new page and place it under a section to make it appear in the sidebar.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv data-block-id=\"block-rkb2l1x7z\" data-block=\"json\" data-specialized-type=\"code-block\" data-content=\"{\u0026quot;id\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;block-rkb2l1x7z\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;json\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;content\u0026quot;:{\u0026quot;type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;json\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;fields\u0026quot;:{\u0026quot;title\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;description\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;code\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;# In PRSS: Posts → Create → choose a parent section\\n# Or set the parent later from the structure editor\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;language\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;bash\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;theme\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;dark\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;showLineNumbers\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;false\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;showCopyButton\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;true\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;showHeader\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;true\u0026quot;}},\u0026quot;specializedType\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;code-block\u0026quot;}\" class=\"json-block\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003ch2\u003eWrite with blocks or HTML\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eUse the editor\u0027s headings, lists, code, and callout blocks. Headings become entries in the “On this page” outline.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"callout\" data-type=\"warning\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHeads up:\u003c/strong\u003e Keep one \u003ccode\u003eh1\u003c/code\u003e per page (the title is added for you) and use \u003ccode\u003eh2\u003c/code\u003e/\u003ccode\u003eh3\u003c/code\u003e for sections.\u003c/div\u003e"
                                                           },
                                                           {
                                                               "ref":  "gs-quickstart",
                                                               "title":  "Quick Start",
                                                               "slug":  "quick-start",
                                                               "template":  "docs",
                                                               "content":  "\u003cp\u003ePublish your first documented feature in three steps.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003e1. Create a section\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eAdd a page named after your topic (for example, “Guides”). It becomes a sidebar group.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003e2. Add pages under it\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eCreate child pages for each article. They appear as links under the group.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv data-block-id=\"block-dkme6wxwf\" data-block=\"json\" data-specialized-type=\"code-block\" data-content=\"{\u0026quot;id\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;block-dkme6wxwf\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;json\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;content\u0026quot;:{\u0026quot;type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;json\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;fields\u0026quot;:{\u0026quot;title\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;description\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;code\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;export function greet(name: string) {\\n  return `Hello, ${name}!`;\\n}\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;language\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;tsx\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;theme\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;dark\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;showLineNumbers\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;false\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;showCopyButton\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;true\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;showHeader\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;true\u0026quot;}},\u0026quot;specializedType\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;code-block\u0026quot;}\" class=\"json-block\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003ch2\u003e3. Preview and deploy\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eUse PRSS preview to review, then deploy to your host of choice.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"callout\" data-type=\"success\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDone!\u003c/strong\u003e Your docs site is live with working navigation and search-friendly pages.\u003c/div\u003e"
                                                           }
                                                       ]
