                                                               "template":  "docs",
                                                               "content":  "\u003cp\u003eThe theme is dark-first with a light mode toggle. Colors are driven by CSS variables so you can rebrand quickly.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eBrand color\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cdiv data-block-id=\"block-1axjpwev0\" data-block=\"json\" data-specialized-type=\"code-block\" data-content=\"{\u0026quot;id\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;block-1axjpwev0\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;json\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;content\u0026quot;:{\u0026quot;type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;json\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;fields\u0026quot;:{\u0026quot;title\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;description\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;code\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;:root {\\n  --docs-accent: #6366f1;\\n}\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;language\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;css\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;theme\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;dark\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;showLineNumbers\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;false\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;showCopyButton\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;true\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;showHeader\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;true\u0026quot;}},\u0026quot;specializedType\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;code-block\u0026quot;}\" class=\"json-block\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003ch2\u003eLogo\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eSet the \u003ccode\u003elogoImageUrl\u003c/code\u003e site variable to show a logo instead of the site title.\u003c/p\u003e"
                                                           },
                                                           {
                                                               "ref":  "guides-deploy",
                                                               "title":  "Deployment",
                                                               "slug":  "deployment",
                                                               "template":  "docs",
                                                               "content":  "\u003cp\u003eShip your docs anywhere PRSS can deploy.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003ePreview locally\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eUse PRSS preview to review the built site before publishing.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003ePublish\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eConnect a host in Site Settings and deploy. Every build regenerates the sidebar and outline from your current pages.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"callout\" data-type=\"success\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTip:\u003c/strong\u003e Keep section names short — they become the sidebar group headers.\u003c/div\u003e"
